From: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:05:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] usb: core: hub: disable U1/U2 LPM for mobile tethering devices to eliminate disconnects

================================================================================
MAXNET High-Performance Kernel Engine & Hardware Architecture Optimization
Engineered & Developed by Mahendra Mali (Max) for MAXNET Router OS
Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
================================================================================

Disable U1/U2 LPM for COMM/WIRELESS/MISC devices to prevent errors -71, -110 on SuperSpeed USB tethering.

Signed-off-by: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
---
--- a/drivers/usb/core/hub.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/core/hub.c
@@ -177,6 +177,18 @@
 	if (!udev->bos)
 		return 0;
 
+	/* MAXNET Tethering Optimization by Mahendra Mali (Max):
+	 * Disable U1/U2 LPM for mobile tethering devices (COMM, WIRELESS, MISC)
+	 * to prevent PHY exit timeouts (errors -71, -110) and unexpected USB disconnects.
+	 * Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
+	 */
+	if (udev->descriptor.bDeviceClass == USB_CLASS_COMM ||
+	    udev->descriptor.bDeviceClass == USB_CLASS_WIRELESS_CONTROLLER ||
+	    udev->descriptor.bDeviceClass == USB_CLASS_MISC ||
+	    (udev->actconfig && udev->actconfig->desc.bNumInterfaces > 0 &&
+	     udev->actconfig->interface[0]->cur_altsetting->desc.bInterfaceClass == USB_CLASS_COMM))
+		return 0;
+
 	/* USB 2.1 (and greater) devices indicate LPM support through
 	 * their USB 2.0 Extended Capabilities BOS descriptor.
 	 */
